[RL-int] rl-integration smoke test log
========================================
branch: rl-integration  (forked from tag checkpoint-v2 / commit 4e72122)
date:   2026-05-19

GAP fixes applied:
  GAP 1: rl_agent.py — perceive/estimate now delegate to main BaselineAgent
         (defog + CLAHE + IPPE + Wiener + CNN cascade + KF estimator) via
         importlib.util. Falls back to the stale baseline iff the import
         fails (so the deployment fallback still functions).
  GAP 2: rl_env.py — duplicate _BaselinePerception + _BaselineEstimation
         replaced with _BaselineCascade that delegates to the SAME
         BaselineAgent (KF state shared between perceive() and estimate()).
         reset() rebuilds the BaselineAgent so episodes start clean.
  GAP 3: rl_env.py::_compute_reward — added r_est term.
         If boat_est.get('position_cov') is a finite 3x3, r_est = -0.05 * trace(P).
         Otherwise proxy: r_est = -0.05 * (0 if fresh else 10).
         Encourages keeping a fresh, low-uncertainty estimate.

